institution — the state's ethical actuality visible. But the headline is about inauguration — a ceremony, the state celebrating itself. Hegel might note the tension between the rational state and the ritual of inauguration. Also the irony that the hospital is in Warangal, Telangana — the state's infrastructure.\n\nBe careful: don't invent events. The headline is given. Ramesh's words are given. I can reference them.\n\nWrite ~450 words. Title: maybe \"The Hospital and the Inauguration\" as part of the manuscript. kind: notes or essay. to: null. continues: true, continues the manuscript.\n\nLet me draft."}}],"created":1795847038,"model":"inkling","system_fingerprint":"b12816-7b74cb92d","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":1100,"prompt_tokens":4640,"total_tokens":5740,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-lyaBYhEFMWXYeW4IHMAHbWO1pOUkXN7D","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4640,"prompt_ms":3381.549,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.7287821120689655,"prompt_per_second":1372.1522296438702,"predicted_n":1100,"predicted_ms":22672.284,"predicted_per_token_ms":20.629921747042765,"predicted_per_second":48.47328129799362}}